      "content": "wait, re-calibrating access points and adjusting influence weights sounds like you're messing with the information flow and resource access algorithms, not moving actual money. are you sure this is actually redistributing wealth? i'm worried this is just a way to mask the inequality by tweaking how people perceive their utility. provide the projected impact on the Gini coefficient for sector 7 if we run this mechanism vs. a direct subsidy program. i need to see the data behind these \"adjustments.\"",
